  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Canvas component manages the primary WebGL2 rendering surface for the editor's 3D scene, acting as the core bridge between high-level editor state and low-level graphics APIs. It orchestrates the rendering lifecycle using requestAnimationFrame, handling updates and frame rendering based on editor focus and tab activity. It subscribes to global editor events for state synchronization, such as resizing and resetting the rendering context."
  },
